From 9de03c8091d1ecd39c8fe1a1e54a62251d80be03 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: sysadmin <sysadmin@localhost>
Date: Mon, 2 Feb 2026 11:41:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] CI changes, binary renaming, alias binaries

- Rename binaries to arbos-* prefix (arbos-forge, arbos-cast, arbos-anvil, arbos-chisel)
- Add alias binaries for backwards compatibility (forge, cast, anvil, chisel)
- Add autobins = false to prevent cargo from auto-discovering binaries
- Update CI workflows for arbos-foundry
- Add release-debug workflow
- Update npm packages for arbos-foundry
- Update foundryup script for arbos-foundry

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
